    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>r</mi></math>&nbsp;be three statements such that the truth value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi></math> .&nbsp;Then the truth values of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>r</mi></math>&nbsp;are respectively :",
